WEBVTT

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:31.130
Kasane!

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:35.310
Kasane?

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:37.220
Kasane?!

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.060
Kasane.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.110
Where are we?

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:55.330
Kasane, take a look at that.

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:02.000
That's the Kunad Highway.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.580
What happened?

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:08.210
We've no idea.

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:11.680
It was like this when we came to.

00:01:13.430 --> 00:01:16.050
I don't know what's going on.

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:18.890
I remember everything
up to the earthquake.

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:22.020
Could an earthquake
cause something like that?

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:23.310
Who knows?

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:27.650
But there appears to be a gravity anomaly
around that ginormous thing.

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:32.780
I can't reach Haruka, and Luka and
Yuito are nowhere to be found.

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:33.780
Yuito's missing?

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:37.160
Oh, no.

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:39.830
Damn it! What the hell's going on?!

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:41.790
Take a chill pill, Shiden.

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:46.170
If Karen's revolt is for real,
something must be afoot in Suoh, too.

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:49.210
Yes, let's head back to Suoh.

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:55.140
What in the world's happening?

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.410
<i>A crime in reality</i>

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:16.700
<i>For Heaven's sake</i>

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:18.620
<i>Accepts any fake</i>

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:21.040
<i>And disappears</i>

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:24.120
<i>Piling the eternity in fantasy</i>

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:25.670
<i>Won't take it at all</i>

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:26.750
<i>I get sick</i>

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:28.670
<i>A girl looking back</i>

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:31.090
<i>Casts the miracle</i>

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:34.050
<i>Into the instant world </i>

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:38.930
<i>Did you lie?</i>

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:40.760
<i>Did you lie?</i>

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.850
<i>Spit the venom </i>

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:48.610
<i>I know why</i>

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:52.190
<i>I've found a game of ecstasy</i>

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:54.820
<i>Red Criminal gets life</i>

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:57.280
<i>I've never been in love</i>

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:03.120
<i>Don't know when I started</i>
<i>getting sick of this world</i>

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.700
<i>We will fly</i>

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.540
<i>Someday I won't be crying</i>

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:12.380
<i>I've been sacrificing myself</i>

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:14.800
<i>Not to hurt anybody</i>

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:33.350
A Doomed Tomorrow

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:35.150
This <i>is </i>Suoh, right?
 What is going on?

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:37.570
It's no longer a functioning city.

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:40.120
Is Arahabaki even operational?

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:43.080
So that's why I can't
get through to Haruka.

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:45.040
I hope she's okay.

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:55.420
Was that a dream?

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.170
Hm? What's this?

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:06.640
This is... our research facility?

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.230
By "our," you mean Spring Pharmaceuticals?

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:15.440
Yeah, but we're not supposed
to have a research facility in Suoh.

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:18.150
Is this really Suoh?

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:20.110
Something's not right.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.790
Is it some kind of medication?

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:28.960
It's got Seiran's mark on it.

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:32.670
It looks like that ampule.

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:35.000
But what's it doing here?

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:46.260
Huh?!

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:47.390
Kasane!

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:51.650
Major General Karen!

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:54.190
You've arrived at last.

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:57.610
Major General!

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:58.740
Kasane!

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:01.070
Finally.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:03.660
I'll finally have some help.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:05.280
Kasane!

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.290
What did he do?

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:09.870
That was one of
Major General Karen's powers.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:12.870
Skill SS Class, Brain Eater.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:17.250
It can copy any kind of psionic power,
making it his own.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.760
Why copy Kasane's power?

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:23.840
He's been able to perform
psychokinesis for ages.

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:26.220
Sorry. I lost him.

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:31.850
Let's go. We have to find out
what happened here in Suoh.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:33.650
Kasane, are you in?

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:34.770
Yes.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:42.450
Psionics, eh?

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:47.120
The world is coming to an end,
and yet you fight?

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.310
Hey! Stop that!

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:17.150
Wait!

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:19.860
Are you Yuito Sumeragi?

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:28.030
And you are Kasane. Kasane Randall.

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:29.200
I knew it.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:32.290
Huh? You're really Yuito Sumeragi?

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:33.580
Him?

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:38.040
Is that Kyoka Eden and
Shiden Ritter I hear?

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:43.300
I think I see what's happening,
though it's hard to believe.

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:46.890
Yuito Sumeragi, it appears you can't see.

00:06:46.890 --> 00:06:47.590
I am--

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:49.550
Arashi Spring.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.180
I know your voice.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:07:02.110
We thought we were in Suoh,
in the solar calendar year 2020.

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:04.360
It seems we were wrong.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:06.660
Indeed, you were.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:09.240
This is Suoh in the year 2070.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:13.160
The year 2070?! How could that...

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:15.580
We've traveled to the future?!

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:20.210
Their time ran out.

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:26.170
They say that only those who possess
the power of time travel

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:30.220
are able to persist in a world
across time and space.

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.810
Time travel?

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:35.810
All those caught up in its power

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:40.150
will be pulled back into their
own time before long.

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:41.650
But I...

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:44.820
Your psionic power is not psychokinesis.

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:46.610
Your power is gravikinesis.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:51.450
Your ability to manipulate dimensions
merely appeared as psychokinesis.

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:54.660
Kasane.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:57.250
You have the power of time travel.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:08:00.290
The power of the Red Strings is yours.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:06.420
That wasn't a dream.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.430
Red Strings...

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:12.220
Those crimson threads are
the power to cross time?

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:25.940
Arahabaki told me you
would come from the past.

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:29.570
But it's been wrong half of the time.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:32.620
What happened?

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:35.910
Following Karen and Seiran's revolt,

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:40.330
New Himuka desperately tried
to protect its credibility.

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:45.380
They made me, Yuito Sumeragi,
into the hero who saved the nation

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:48.670
in an effort to distract the people.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.970
My father was assassinated,

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:54.600
and the authorities
hunted you as his killer.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:56.720
Me? Kill Chairman Sumeragi?!

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:01.560
I did <i>not </i>kill your father.

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:08.780
After that, the violence between
Suoh and Seiran only grew worse.

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:14.910
I spent my days battling Others
and psionics from Seiran.

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:19.330
Meanwhile, it began to grow.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:26.170
The quasi-black hole
we created back then--

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:28.130
the Kunad Gate.

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:30.010
We did that?

00:09:30.010 --> 00:09:36.470
Our psionic power is gravikinesis,
and we both use a similar form.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:39.770
In short, I, too, am capable
of time travel.

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:43.730
They say I, too, possess Red Strings.

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:46.400
Our powers resonated with each other,

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:48.980
creating the Kunad Gate.

00:09:54.450 --> 00:10:00.290
But my power wasn't great enough
to cross space and time.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:02.540
Now what?!

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:07.130
The Kunad Gate has grown so massive
that it threatens to devour the world.

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:08.630
The whole world?!

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:18.600
The gate appeared
during our time travel event

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:21.560
and should have swiftly disappeared.

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:26.900
But it resonated with my power,
causing it to stabilize and persist.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:30.860
And each time I use psionics,

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:36.030
it warps the space around it,
devouring more of this world.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:37.740
There's no way to stop it?

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:41.870
It is my power that sustains it.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.910
The gate would vanish if I died.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:44.790
What?

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:48.790
That was the only way to stop it.

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:55.760
But I chose not to die.

00:10:57.010 --> 00:11:00.760
I was persuaded by those around me
that there was some other way.

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:04.480
So it was that I searched
for a way to survive.

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:10.320
But the gate has grown so massive
that it won't now vanish even if I died.

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:14.820
I failed to choose death.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:27.540
Kasane, kill me.

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:31.250
I need you to do this.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:34.210
You must kill me.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.670
Are you insane?

00:11:38.470 --> 00:11:42.760
Return to your time 50 years ago,
before the Kunad Gate grew too large,

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:48.060
and end the life of the false hero,
Yuito Sumeragi.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:49.940
I can't do that.

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:53.230
Besides, I don't know how
to return to my own time.

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:55.860
There is a way.

00:11:55.860 --> 00:12:00.530
The Red Strings are triggered
by powerful emotions,

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:05.700
specifically traumatic events
that deeply scar one's psyche.

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:08.330
Under government orders,

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:13.590
Suoh conducted research
on turning humans into Others.

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:19.340
That day, Suoh forces attempted to fire
a metamorphosis round at a Seiran soldier.

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:20.930
No!

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:26.560
That research was conducted
at my father's behest.

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:28.390
And I...

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.560
The one they called a hero

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:34.940
knew the truth, yet I
took over that research.

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:37.360
You took it over?

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:40.610
Many people were turned
into Others because of me,

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:43.700
just like Naomi was.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:46.040
And it was all done to study psionics

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:49.750
and find a way in which
I didn't have to die.

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:55.460
Yuito, what have you done?

00:13:00.470 --> 00:13:03.300
Forgive me, Kasane.

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.970
You're my only hope.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.430
Yuito!

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:10.390
Kill me!

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.690
Save the world!

00:13:12.690 --> 00:13:15.230
Save the future!

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:49.770
Am I back in my own time?

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:51.560
Kasane? Kasane!

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.060
Haruka?!

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:56.690
Arashi and the others are all fine.
They told me what happened.

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.480
The revolt has plunged Suoh into chaos!

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:02.530
If you can hear me, we need to meet.

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:04.860
Go to--

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:07.330
Haruka? Haruka!

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:11.620
A revolt in Suoh?
And Yuito and the rest are there?

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:14.370
The gate would vanish if I died.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:17.380
Many people were turned
into Others because of me,

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:19.300
just like Naomi was.

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.050
Yuito.

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:30.640
I couldn't return from the future
where I saw Yuito

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:33.520
until the Red Strings drew me back.

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:37.860
The present I returned to should
now have a different future.

00:14:37.860 --> 00:14:40.940
But the Kunad Gate is still here.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:43.990
If we don't do something,
the world will...

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:48.700
People of New Himuka with your eyes shut

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:53.200
and all you fools who choose
to look the other way...

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.460
I am Karen Travers.

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:58.000
I reject New Himuka's
surveillance society.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.000
My eyes are opened wide.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:04.010
My comrades and I are resolved
to walk hand in hand with Seiran,

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.010
Karen, why are you doing this?

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:06.300
which is of the same mind.

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:12.810
Too close for comfort.

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:17.480
I gotta watch out. Some of them
have a keen sense of smell.

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:21.440
Kagero.

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:28.910
The council's shelter!

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:33.120
This is bad.

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:35.410
The gate's open!

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:52.220
Chairman Sumeragi!

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:54.720
Hang in there, Mr. Chairman.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:57.600
Th-The Others Suppression Force...

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:00.310
That was Toge...

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:03.480
Save your strength.
I'll call the medical team at once.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:07.280
No, I won't last much longer.

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:12.280
Forget about me. Save yourself.

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:17.250
Mr. Chairman, I need to ask you something.

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:22.380
Was it the New Himukan government
who turned Naomi Randall into an Other?

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:32.300
So, what Yuito said 50 years from now...

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.720
But I chose not to die.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.640
Kill me!

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:38.810
Save the world!

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:41.860
Save the future!

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:57.160
K-- Kasane?

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:58.710
Father?

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:08.420
Kasane?! What are you doing?

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:11.840
What happened to my dad?

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:15.510
That blood on your knife.
Don't tell me you...

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:16.890
Yuito!

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.680
Kasane!

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:20.270
Mr. Chairman!

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:29.240
Time to fall back, don't you think?

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:32.610
Wait!

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:35.330
Yuito...

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:36.700
Yuito.

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.500
Dad!

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:42.370
Yuito, forgive me.

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:45.500
There is something

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:48.050
I must tell you.

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:49.760
Watch your back.

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:51.840
This nation...

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:54.010
...wants you...

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:00.100
Dad!

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:02.850
No! Dad!

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:06.820
Dad.

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:18.910
You were heavily outnumbered back there.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.250
Kagero.

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:22.620
Why were you arguing with Yuito?

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:26.750
Did you side with Karen?
That's why you offed Chairman Sumeragi?

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.130
No! That wasn't me!

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:31.130
What have <i>you </i>been doing?

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:34.550
I was trying to save the council bigwigs.

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:38.350
But unfortunately, I was too late.

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:41.270
Kasane? I'm sorry I got cut off earlier.

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:43.560
I've rendezvoused with the others.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:45.690
We're currently...

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:51.570
Kasane!

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:55.570
Kyoka.

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:58.990
I'm so glad you made it back, too.

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:03.830
We were back in this time
before we knew it.

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:05.830
What's that supposed to mean?

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:08.500
We'll save that for later, Kagero.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:09.920
All right, Kasane.

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:13.470
What happened after we were
time-shifted back here?

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:19.300
Red Strings and the Kunad Gate?

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:22.270
They're turning people into Others?
Naomi, too?

00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:24.680
You expect us to believe that?

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:28.060
The world will end
if we don't kill Yuito?!

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:30.730
Just as Yuito said 50 years in the future,

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:34.240
Chairman Sumeragi was attacked by someone.

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:39.030
Under the circumstances,
I can see why I'm a suspect.

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:44.080
So then you really were
going to kill the boy.

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.330
Kasane!

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:55.420
Karen!

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:58.680
I've been looking for you, Kasane.

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:06.980
We have an update!

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:09.600
The recovery work on
Arahabaki is complete.

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:13.110
And the rebel forces
have lifted the cordon.

00:20:13.110 --> 00:20:14.570
I see.

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:16.400
And Kasane Randall?

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:18.110
Whereabouts unknown.

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:19.450
Continue the search.

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:20.570
Yes, sir!

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:41.680
Kasane! What are you doing?

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:44.970
That blood on your knife.
Don't tell me you...

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:51.270
Personality rehabilitation is
an open secret among the OSF.

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:55.480
So it was true.

00:20:55.480 --> 00:21:03.410
We are all livestock used and exploited
for the sake of the government and nation.

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:07.750
And my dad and brother knew about it.

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:09.540
Watch your back.

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:11.540
This nation...

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:13.290
...wants you...

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:16.460
Yuito?

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:19.470
It's nothing. I'm fine.

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.310
Where's Kasane?

00:21:25.310 --> 00:21:27.270
She ran off.

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:28.850
But thanks to Tsugumi,

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:32.900
we know she reached the rendezvous point
with Kyoka Platoon.

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.490
Karen!

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:44.780
Kagero was with them.

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:46.370
He was?

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:51.540
It seems nearly half the OSF headed off
to Seiran with Major General Karen.

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:55.710
And it's rumored that Seiran
will declare independence.

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:57.130
Everyone!

00:21:57.130 --> 00:21:58.170
Wataru!

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:00.220
Psynet must be back online.

00:22:00.220 --> 00:22:02.090
Wataru, Haruka is--

00:22:02.090 --> 00:22:05.050
Yeah, I know.

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:07.100
She's there with you, right?

00:22:07.100 --> 00:22:11.730
Her motherly instinct won't let her
abandon Kasane or anyone else.

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:14.020
But no worries.

00:22:16.110 --> 00:22:17.570
Yuito.

00:22:17.570 --> 00:22:18.940
Kaito.

00:22:18.940 --> 00:22:20.820
I need you at HQ now.

00:22:20.820 --> 00:22:24.820
I need you to become a hero.

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:26.320
Huh?

00:24:09.130 --> 00:24:11.880
The Hunt for Nagi
